==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*do}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{ru-IPA|до́-}} {{i|when stressed}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[up to]]
#: {{prefex|ru|-йти́|t1=to go|дойти́|t2=to go up to, to reach}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[completely]] {{gloss|describing a completion of an action to its end}}
#: {{prefex|ru|чита́ть|t1=to read|дочита́ть|t2=to finish reading}}
# {{lb|ru|used with adjectives and nouns}} [[pre-]], [[ante-]] {{gloss|earlier in time}}
#: {{prefex|ru|истори́ческий|t1=historic|доистори́ческий|t2=prehistoric}}

====Usage notes====
* The stressed variant is found in the following situations:
*# the past participle of verbs with a one-syllable root ending in {{lang|ru|-ать}}: e.g. {{m|ru|до́сланный}} from {{m|ru|досла́ть}}, {{m|ru|до́рванный}} from {{m|ru|дорва́ть}};
*# the past tense of some verbs with a one-syllable root: e.g. {{m|ru|[[до́лил]], [[доли́л]]|pos=masculine singular past tense}} from {{m|ru|доли́ть||to [[fill]] by [[pour]]ing, to [[pour]] [[more]]}};
*# some deverbal nouns: e.g. {{m|ru|до́говор||[[contract]], [[agreement]], [[treaty]]}} from {{m|ru|договори́ться||to [[agree]]}}, {{m|ru|до́мысел||[[guesswork]], [[speculation]]}} from {{m|ru|домы́слить}}, {{m|ru|до́пуск||[[access]], [[admittance]]}} from {{m|ru|допуска́ть||to [[admit]]}};
*# some adverbs: e.g. {{m|ru|до́низу||to the [[bottom]]}}, {{m|ru|до́чиста||[[until]] [[spotless]]}}.

